# Full simulation runs and script outputs are TRACKED (see results/README.md
# and outputs/README.md): raw run files (simulation.log, summary_v2.json/csv,
# stage_results_v2.json/csv, checkpoint.json) and plots (*.png) are pushed so a
# run can be reviewed and cited from GitHub. Only bulk binaries that the run
# itself can regenerate stay local:
results/**/*.h5
results/**/*.hdf5
results/**/*.pkl
results/**/*.parquet
results/**/*.zip
results/**/*.mat
outputs/**/*.h5
outputs/**/*.hdf5
outputs/**/*.pkl
outputs/**/*.parquet
outputs/**/*.zip
outputs/**/*.mp4

# Thesis, drafting history, and reference library (local; keep out of the software repo)
